--------------------------------------------------------------------------

All original material in this repository is the exclusive property of the
copyright holder. This includes, without limitation:

  - the curriculum design, learning objectives and information architecture;
  - all written teaching content, callouts, pearls and explanatory prose;
  - the question bank, answer explanations and teaching pearls;
  - the clinical cases and their progressive-disclosure reasoning;
  - the glossary, biomarker atlas and reference tables;
  - the interactive laboratories and simulations, and their illustrations;
  - the design system (colour tokens, typography, layout and components);
  - the HTML, CSS and JavaScript source code;
  - the selection, coordination and arrangement of all of the above,
