--------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The three-dimensional model on the opening screen is drawn with three.js,
loaded at run time from a public content delivery network under its own
MIT licence; it is not redistributed in this repository.

The videos are embedded from their publishers' own channels (Cold Spring
Harbor Laboratory DNA Learning Center, Illumina, and Emory University
CancerQuest) and remain the property of those publishers. They are not
copied or hosted here.

The learning objectives are mapped to the published content specifications
of the American Board of Pathology, which remain the property of the Board.
They are referenced, not reproduced. This work is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the American Board of Pathology.

