This primer is an educational teaching aid. It is not a clinical protocol,
not a substitute for institutional policy, current guidelines, a
laboratory's own validated procedures or professional clinical judgement,
and it does not constitute medical advice. Drug names are given as examples
only. Clinical decisions must be confirmed against current guidance before
being applied to any patient.

